### Tạo Admin đầu tiên (Chỉ hoạt động khi chưa có admin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/create-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "User"
}

### Tạo Admin với Secret Key (An toàn hơn)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/create-admin-secure
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin2@example.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "Two",
  "secretKey": "your-secret-key-here"
}

### Đăng nhập Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Tạo Admin mới qua Admin API (Cần authentication)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "Admin",
  "role": "admin"
}








